<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<!-- GT_esmini verification asset: 500 m straight 2-lane road with a STOP sign
     (OpenDRIVE type 206, country de) governing lane -1 at s=200, PLUS a
     stop-line signal (type=294, country=OpenDRIVE, dynamic=no) at s=195, 5 m
     before it (2 m off sign_stop_margin 3.0), so the margin-based and
     stop-line-based stop targets land at different s (design/
     stop_line_stop_target.md sec13.1). type=294 is not an ASAM-defined pattern
     for a stop line; it mirrors the one real-world stop-line signal on file in
     this repo (multi_intersections.xodr road196, id=292). Cloned from
     straight_stop_sign.xodr (geometry/lanes unchanged) with the second signal
     added. Used by 04_traffic_signs/stop_sign_stop_line_paired. -->
